    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "UT MD Anderson offers diagnostic services in convenient, community-based locations. Diagnostic imaging clinics offer blood draws and preventative screening. A sub-specialized radiologist with expertise on advanced imaging techniques is available at each location."
